! JPSS VIIRS SCF reader test (GEOSldas_GridComp 5d4d636), run A2 (MODIS Aqua + Terra)
! all species assim/getinnov = .false. by default (cee4997 LDASsa_DEFAULT_inputs_ensupd.nml)

&ens_upd_inputs

